      'Gaziantep Tour: Visit old museums, taste baklava and stay at a guesthouse.',
      'Trabzon Tour: Hike in the mountains and go camping by the Black Sea.',
      'Ankara Tour: Visit the parliament and eat dinner at a famous restaurant.'
